{"id":"fdb41373-61df-47e3-b5e2-5a83785ca4e0","createdAt":"2026-10-26T13:23:27.451Z","batchId":"pricing_claude-haiku-5-5_medium","approach":"html","modelId":"claude-haiku-5-5","settings":{"effort":"medium"},"presetId":"pricing","prompt":"A pricing page with three plans (Free, Pro, Team), their features and a call to action for each.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h1>Simple, transparent pricing</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Start free and upgrade when your team needs more power. Every plan includes unlimited projects and 99.9% uptime.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row center gap-sm\">\n      <span class=\"small\" id=\"billing-monthly-label\">Monthly</span>\n      <label class=\"check\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"billing-toggle\" aria-label=\"Bill annually\">\n        <span>Annual</span>\n      </label>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Save 20% annually</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3\">\n\n      <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"between\">\n          <h3>Free</h3>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Current plan</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">For individuals exploring the basics.</p>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n            <span class=\"stat-value\">$0</span>\n            <span class=\"muted small\">forever</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-block\">Get started</button>\n        <hr>\n        <ul class=\"stack gap-sm small\">\n          <li>Up to 3 projects</li>\n          <li>1 GB file storage</li>\n          <li>Community support</li>\n          <li>Basic analytics (7-day history)</li>\n          <li class=\"muted\">Team collaboration</li>\n          <li class=\"muted\">Custom domains</li>\n          <li class=\"muted\">Priority support</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"between\">\n          <h3>Pro</h3>\n          <span class=\"badge\">Most popular</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">For freelancers and creators who ship often.</p>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"stat-value\" data-price-monthly=\"12\" data-price-annual=\"10\">$12</span>\n          <span class=\"muted small\" data-period>per user / month</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"small muted\" data-note>Billed monthly. Cancel anytime.</p>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-block\">Start 14-day trial</button>\n        <hr>\n        <ul class=\"stack gap-sm small\">\n          <li>Unlimited projects</li>\n          <li>50 GB file storage</li>\n          <li>Email support within 24 hours</li>\n          <li>Full analytics (1-year history)</li>\n          <li>Custom domains</li>\n          <li>Remove branding</li>\n          <li class=\"muted\">Team collaboration</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"between\">\n          <h3>Team</h3>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Best for growth</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">For teams that collaborate across projects.</p>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"stat-value\" data-price-monthly=\"29\" data-price-annual=\"24\">$29</span>\n          <span class=\"muted small\" data-period>per user / month</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"small muted\" data-note>Minimum 3 users. Billed monthly.</p>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-block\">Contact sales</button>\n        <hr>\n        <ul class=\"stack gap-sm small\">\n          <li>Everything in Pro</li>\n          <li>500 GB shared storage</li>\n          <li>Unlimited team members</li>\n          <li>Role-based permissions and SSO</li>\n          <li>Audit logs</li>\n          <li>Priority support with 4-hour response</li>\n          <li>99.99% uptime SLA</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"small muted\">Prices shown in USD and exclude applicable taxes. Need a custom plan for more than 500 users? <a href=\"#\">Talk to our team</a>.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var toggle = document.getElementById('billing-toggle');\n  var monthlyLabel = document.getElementById('billing-monthly-label');\n  var prices = document.querySelectorAll('[data-price-monthly]');\n  function render() {\n    var annual = toggle.checked;\n    monthlyLabel.classList.toggle('muted', annual);\n    prices.forEach(function (el) {\n      el.textContent = '$' + el.dataset[annual ? 'priceAnnual' : 'priceMonthly'];\n      var card = el.closest('.card');\n      card.querySelector('[data-note]').textContent = annual\n        ? 'Billed annually. Save 20% versus monthly.'\n        : (card.querySelector('h3').textContent === 'Team'\n            ? 'Minimum 3 users. Billed monthly.'\n            : 'Billed monthly. Cancel anytime.');\n    });\n  }\n  toggle.addEventListener('change', render);\n  render();\n})();\n</script>","deltas":[[2771,"<div class=\"page\">"],[2771,"\n  <div class=\"stack g"],[2771,"ap-lg\">\n    <"],[2771,"div class=\"stack g"],[2772,"ap-sm\">\n      <"],[2772,"h1>Sim"],[2772,"ple, trans"],[2772,"parent pricing</h1"],[2772,">\n      <p class=\"l"],[2772,"ead\">Start free and"],[2772," up"],[2772,"grade when your"],[2772," team need"],[2772,"s more power"],[2772,"."],[2772," Every plan includ"],[2773,"es un"],[2773,"limited proj"],[2773,"ects an